  (text "Note: Limit the input voltage\nto about 2 Vpp, and use R101/R103\nto set a gain of 0.1, so as to\navoid overloading the output\ntransistors!"
    (at 21.59 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3eaf2f34-a245-49f2-bf9e-630d1f8d4ce5)
  )
  (text "NOTE: This circuit failed at\nhigh audio frequencies because\nof a phase shift between its\ninput and the current monitor."
    (at 205.74 184.15 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 49f403ac-ee0c-4a8f-a61b-2fd0cb360743)
  )
  (text "C101, C102: Aluminum electrolytic, 25V or higher.\nC103-C111: Ceramic, X7R or Y5V, 25V or higher.\nAll resistors: 1.4 W, 1% metal film.\nRV101: 10k multiturn trimpot."
    (at 17.78 156.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 64edd57c-2bea-4522-912d-ae4ea939d755)
  )
  (text "Procedure:\n\nSet RV101 fully counterclockwise.\nShort-circuit J101.\nConnect ±6 V power supply to J102\nWith J101 shorted, adjust RV101 to give\n65 mV between TP101 and TP102.\n\nConnect AWG to J101. Connect oscilloscope\nchannel 1 to the AWG output and channel\n2 to TP103.\n\nUse 8R2 resistor as a dummy load in place\nof Device Under Test.\nSet AWG for a 1 kHz sine wave, 2V_{pp},\nObserve that scope waveforms should both\nbe sinusoidal and in phase with one another.\nChannel 2 should measure approximately 2.4V_{pp}.\n\nReplace the dummy load with the DUT.\nRun the companion software to perform\na frequency sweep."
    (at 17.78 132.08 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6e02a4d9-09fe-488c-a50a-1ef8592506cb)
  )
  (text "Driver\nstage" (at 162.56 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 73cc934d-d4e4-4f11-9b73-7467d8404ff8)
  )
  (text "AWG" (at 21.59 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 7830eff2-c83f-4ac0-97c5-4a3b0914a3b5)
  )
  (text "Power entry\nand bypassing" (at 43.18 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 7b0170b2-7c37-4b44-858c-a50154068b57)
  )
  (text "Unused\nop amp" (at 53.34 85.09 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 9cf9939e-0a19-4999-95ee-b92b9306fbb3)
  )
  (text "Current sense amp\nr_{m} = 100 mV/mA" (at 213.36 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left bottom))
